# BYD deploy workflow

Live site: https://byd.talbyte.com  
GitHub: https://github.com/Muhammad-Talha-Qamar/BYD-Dolphin-Surf-website (`main`)

After finishing any code/content changes to this site:

1. Commit with a concise why-focused message
2. Push to `origin/main`
3. Hostinger Git auto-deploy updates https://byd.talbyte.com from that push
4. Do not wait for an explicit commit/push/deploy request
5. Briefly confirm the subdomain will refresh

Git safety still applies: no force-push to main, no secrets, no amend of already-pushed commits unless asked.
